  "statement": "The task sums, over all subarrays of n ≤ 4·10^5 values below 2^25, the minimum XOR reachable after increasing exactly one element. Even-length subarrays give 0; an odd one gives the common high-bit prefix of its AND and XOR. Fixing the right end, the AND takes at most 26 values on contiguous blocks, each a range query over prefix XORs in a persistent binary trie.",
